    "title": "26% of Travelers Put Travel Costs on Card Installments",
    "summary": "For many consumers, planning a trip now includes deciding how to divide the bill as carefully as deciding where to go. The PYMNTS Intelligence report “Credit Card Installments Outrun BNPL in Summer Travel Surge,” the November edition of The Pay Later Ecosystem Report, examined how consumers used credit cards, card installments, and buy now, pay […]\nThe post 26% of Travelers Put Travel Costs on Card Installments appeared first on PYMNTS.com.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://www.pymnts.com/transportation/travel-payments/2026/26-percent-of-travelers-put-travel-costs-on-card-installments/",
    "source": "PYMNTS",
    "tags": [
      "PYMNTS.com"
    ],
    "origin": "rss",
    "pubDate": "2026-09-15T08:00:17.000Z",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-15T09:01:20.630Z",
    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "A recent PYMNTS Intelligence report reveals that 26% of travelers are using credit card installments to cover their trip expenses. As consumers plan their summer getaways, deciding how to divide the bill has become as crucial as choosing the destination. The study highlights how credit card installments are outpacing buy now, pay later options during the travel surge.",
    "content_ta": "தற்போதைய PYMNTS Intelligence அறிக்கையின்படி, 26% பயணிகள் தங்கள் பயணச் செலவுகளைச் சமாளிக்க கிரெடிட் கார்டு தவணை முறைகளைப் பயன்படுத்துகின்றனர். கோடைக்காலப் பயணங்களைத் திட்டமிடும் நுகர்வோர், இலக்கைத் தேர்ந்தெடுப்பதைப் போலவே கட்டணத்தைப் பிரிப்பது குறித்தும் சிந்திப்பதாக அந்த ஆய்வு காட்டுகிறது.",
    "slug": "26-of-travelers-put-travel-costs-on-card-installments"
  },
